  "id": "sales-agent-market-building-dynamics-eco",
  "name": "Sales Agent Market Building Dynamics",
  "description": "A comprehensive model of sales agent career dynamics including lead generation through referrals, client acquisition and maintenance, effort allocation, and financial sustainability. Models the two-tier client system common in financial services (e.g., insurance sales), where agents balance time between acquiring new leads, servicing existing clients, and maintaining financial viability through a startup subsidy period.",
